/*
 * SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
 *
 * AcoustEEEcare v7.2 overlay — Seeed XIAO nRF52840 Sense
 *
 * CHANGES FROM v5.3:
 *   Removed &xiao_spi / sdhc0 / sdmmc-disk block entirely.
 *   SD card support was dropped in v6.7; keeping the DTS node
 *   without CONFIG_DISK_DRIVER_SDMMC=y / CONFIG_SPI=y caused
 *   a DTS binding error at build time ("no driver for compatible
 *   zephyr,sdmmc-disk found").
 *
 * SAADC (AIN0 / P0.02):
 *   nrfx_saadc accesses the SAADC peripheral directly.
 *   No DTS node is needed or appropriate when CONFIG_ADC=n.
 *
 * LEDs (led0=red, led1=green, led2=blue):
 *   Aliases are already defined in the upstream board DTS for
 *   xiao_ble / xiao_ble_sense.  No override needed here.
 *
 * This file is intentionally left with no active nodes.
 * It is kept so west build -b xiao_ble_nrf52840_sense can
 * reference it via boards/<board>.overlay without errors.
 */
